{"id":"646007","name":"凉拌猪肝","author":"糖糖食味记","authorId":"12729364","desc":"","cover":"images/646007/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肝","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"淀粉","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备一块猪肝。","img":"images/646007/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成薄片，清洗干净之后放入葱姜蒜料酒腌制20—30分钟。","img":"images/646007/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"腌制好的猪肝加入半个蛋清，2勺淀粉。","img":"images/646007/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水开后滑水40—60秒。","img":"images/646007/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出备用。","img":"images/646007/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入适量盐、一勺酱油，一勺醋，适量鸡精，两勺辣椒油。少许麻油、两滴蚝油、适量蒜。","img":"images/646007/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放入一把香菜。","img":"images/646007/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀装盘即可。","img":"images/646007/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/646007/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/646007/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}